    "stations": [],
    "notes": "<p>The personal ship of Devriele Shanassin, corsair lord of the Lucullus system, flown out of the hidden mobile base Icewalk. A boarding pod and a fifteen-missile launch tube say what it is for.</p><p>The statblock prints no armour, no defences and no power rating, so the ship shows an unpowered plant on the sheet - that is the source, not a conversion loss. Its compartments sum to the full 32 durability points, which agrees with carrying no armour.</p>",
    "description": "<dl class=\"alternity-source-stats\"><dt>Source</dt><dd>StarDrive Campaign Setting, Lucullus system</dd><dt>Hull</dt><dd>Vashon-class raider (Military), hull size 32</dd><dt>Progress Level</dt><dd>7</dd><dt>Compartments</dt><dd>8</dd><dt>Toughness</dt><dd>Amazing - as every spaceship is (GM Guide Ch.11)</dd><dt>Manoeuvre rating</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Acceleration</dt><dd>2 Mm per phase</dd><dt>Cruising speed</dt><dd>1.5 AU per hour</dd><dt>Engine</dt><dd>Induction engine</dd><dt>Power plant</dt><dd>Mass reactor</dd><dt>FTL</dt><dd>Stardrive, 0 light-years per starfall</dd><dt>Armor</dt><dd>None</dd><dt>Computer</dt><dd>undefined core</dd><dt>Berthing</dt><dd>18</dd><dt>Compartment durability assigned</dt><dd>32 of 32</dd><dt>Scan damage</dt><dd>The engineering-2 compartment printed as &quot;8/6/3&quot;, which is not a legal 2n/2n/n triple; read as 6/6/3, which the hull-size sum confirms.</dd></dl>"
